OL,3,GNEWSAPetition seeks funding for lip
OL,4,Areading classes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA language lecturer has launched a
OL,7,Fpetition for government funding to
OL,8,Fsupport her lip-reading lessons.
OL,10,FMartina Esser teaches lip reading to
OL,11,Fhearing impaired people but said her
OL,12,Flessons had to be paid for privately
OL,13,Fbecause her funding bids had been
OL,14,Frefused.
OL,16,FShe said the skill could be vital for
OL,17,Fthe mental health, wellbeing and
OL,18,Ffeeling of inclusion: "Hearing loss is
OL,19,Fa hidden disability and leads to social
OL,20,Fisolation as you can't join in with
OL,21,Fconversations and miss out on funny
OL,22,Finteractions."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
