OL,3,GNEWSAPetition seeks funding for lip
OL,4,Areading classes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,7,Fsaid those running lip reading classes
OL,8,Fcould apply for funding from its #1.4bn
OL,9,FAdult Skills Fund.
